<https://w3id.org/smtg/id/printing/11bf83bb-c95b-4b4f-9a56-ce7a1816307a/face/1/flavor-text> smtg:textValue "\"Unfortunately, all my test animals have died or escaped, so I shall be the final subject. I feel no fear. This is a momentous night.\"\n—Laboratory notes, final entry"@en;
